ipatool-rs is an experimental Rust rewrite informed by ipatool and UnfairPlay.
The project is distributed under the MIT License; see LICENSE. The original
ipatool MIT copyright notice is retained there.

UnfairPlay contains code developed in the ipatool project and its DrWhax
FairPlay research fork. Its main license is MIT. See
https://github.com/DrWhax/unfairplay and its LICENSE and NOTICE files.

The in-process AES differential-fault recovery code was adapted from the
Apache-2.0 DarkPhoenix subset in UnfairPlay. The modified Rust source files
carry attribution notices. See licenses/LICENSE-DARKPHOENIX.txt for the
Apache-2.0 license text.

